{{ToonInfo|Toon=Shrimpo|extra=Shrimp|Date=June 14, 2024|type=Single|Pronoun=He}} 

==Appearance==
Shrimpo is a shrimp abdomen with a perpetually angry face. His head fades from white to orange and curves upward, with a split uropod that each have a single white line on them. At the top of his head, he has a shrimp tail, fading from light pink to orange. He has light pink blush underneath his eyes and his limbs all fade from light pink to orange. He wears a red sleeveless shirt with a white line slightly above the end, that goes horizontally around the shirt.

==Personality==
Shrimpo mostly comes off as unnecessarily aggressive and rude. Despite his cute appearance, he can be described as hurtful, selfish, and is also threatening, reaching the point of murder for an unknown reason shown in the interaction with [[Looey]]. Whenever he is not hating, he refers to himself in third person, boasting about how good he is.

Shrimpo shows barely any major depth throughout his personality, contrasting him from most stereotypical bully characters in most children's media who usually do have good hearts deep down or eventually get redeemed. He is an abrasive, short-tempered [[Toon]] who is relentlessly angry for no discernible reason. The most notable part of his personality is that he claims hatred for anyone, anything, and everything, and sees himself on a high level, occasionally praising himself and only himself, sometimes in the third person. Even when {{CI|Waxwell|name=true}} eggs him on and encourages his anger, he expresses his hatred towards Waxwell, not even being an ally of the fellow antagonist.

Shrimpo does not care about other Toons' feelings at all. This is showcased in his 2 interactions as Shrimpo torments {{CI|Squirm|name=true}}, making the latter cry. The former even goes ahead and mocks Squirm's crying. He also dismisses any kind of criticism or logic when any of the Toons call him out for his behavior, sometimes even silencing them, even if they try to care about him, such as in his interaction with {{CI|Astro|name=true}}.

Shrimpo screams in all his dialogue, except for the one with {{CI|Sprout|name=true}}, as he is the only Toon capable of shutting him down and even intimidating him. Another implication behind easy intimidation could be {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}, thanks to her acknowledging his strength in a way that shocks him. In one of his conversations with {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}, he shows no willingness to change for the better, again setting him apart from other typical bullies.

However, as much as a bully he is, it is merely assumed by some that Shrimpo might actually have a softer side after all, as {{CI|Dandy|name=true}} assumes that he and {{CI|Finn|name=true}} could be friends solely because he saw them walking next to each other while unable to tell if it's genuine and he eats {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}'s food despite hating it (though the latter scenario could only be because he needs to eat for the sake of sustenance, having no other option). Also, despite his rudeness and aggression, Shrimpo seldom physically harms anyone, though the only known instance of this is when he pushed {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}} so severely he needed a bandage.

