***'''{{TI|Train Whistle|name=true}}''', to completely nullify the {{Debuff|Slow|}} Debuff, making {{CI|Twisted Vee|name=true}} significantly easier to survive. You also won't be slowed from [[Ichor Puddles]];
***'''{{TI|Blushy Bat|name=true}}''', to prevent sequences of hits for running out of Stamina by sparing more time to gain distance from Twisteds;
***'''{{TI|Soul Sword|name=true}}''', to slow the Twisteds down when you get hit so you can escape from them quicker;
***'''{{TI|Star Pillow|name=true}}''', to regenerate [[Stamina]] faster while extracting, taking advantage of his low Stamina and slow extraction;
