==Trivia==
*Shrimpo is designation SC-002, with the '''SC''' standing for Side Character.
*Shrimpo is the cheapest [[Toon]] in [[Dandy's Store]], costing a measly 100 {{TI|Ichor|name=true}}.
*Shrimpo's interaction with {{CI|Toodles|name=true}} could be based on the "WE'RE GONNA CRASH" meme. This is also the first time he does not insult anyone, but he does intentionally try to frighten Toodles into thinking the Elevator will get them both killed.
*Although it says he has 1{{Star}} [[Stealth]], Shrimpo has the lowest Stealth for a [[Toon]] with -99, as his Passive [[Ability]] decreases his Stealth drastically. This is equivalent to around -20 Stars in Stealth, much lower than {{CI|Brightney|name=true}} or {{CI|Gourdy|name=true}}.
**Notably, this is significantly lower than what {{II|Air Horn|name=true}} and {{CI|Pebble|name=true}}'s {{AI|Pebble|name=true}} Ability sets your Stealth to.
**Only {{CI|Blot|name=true}}'s Ability, {{AI|Blot|name=true}}, has lower Stealth than Shrimpo at -999. However, since Blot Jr. is not a playable character and instead is an Ability, Shrimpo still has the lowest Stealth of all the Toons.
**Using {{TI|Coal|name=true}} or {{TI|Scrapbook|name=true}} with Shrimpo will increase his Stealth Stat, as a negative number multiplied by a negative percentage would increase it.
***On the other hand, using the {{TI|Diary|name=true}} [[Trinket]] will decrease his Stealth due to the opposite applying.
*Shrimpo's interaction with {{CI|Sprout|name=true}} is the only time he stops yelling and talking at all.
*In [[Roleplay Mode]], equipping and viewing Shrimpo's actions reveals a unique set of messages that are different from any other [[Toon]]. For example, Shrimpo's blink action is called "BLINK!!!", his hurt expression is called "SHRIMPO DOES NOT GET HURT!!!", and his normal expression is called "MY AWESOME FACE!!!", which could imply these were written by Shrimpo himself.
*According to his interactions with {{CI|Scraps|name=true}}, Shrimpo likes dogs more than cats, but he hates both of them. This is the only time Shrimpo openly confesses about liking something, even though he still hates it.
*Shrimpo is the only [[Toon]] to have less than 15 Stars in his [[Stat]] pool, only having 5.
**Shrimpo is the only Toon to have a Star in all of his Stats to this day, making him the hardest Toon to use effectively, befitting his role as a joke character.
*Shrimpo would be the kind of [[Toon]] who would put the milk before the cereal, as confirmed in a New Year QnA stream.
*What Shrimpo 'hates' is prompted by the current situation/conversation. Due to this, the patterns on such can be very inconsistent and contradictory.
**For example, Shrimpo admonishes {{CI|Teagan|name=true}} for asking what he hates, but he doesn't when {{CI|Eggson|name=true}} asks if he hated him specifically, even though it technically reveals what he hates, meaning Shrimpo did it for no reason.
**Another example is Shrimpo telling {{CI|Vee|name=true}} he hates not having the last word, despite not doing this in 15 of his interactions, unless Shrimpo just now knew this.
*From the information given by one of {{CI|Dandy|name=true}}'s gossip dialogues and in their dialogue, Shrimpo may not be as harsh on {{CI|Finn|name=true}} than as with the other [[Toons]], and that he might even be friends with him. Whether or not this is a genuine friendship is unknown
**It is also indicated that Shrimpo (genuinely) listens to Finn's jokes and facts, as revealed in one of their dialogues.
*No one seems to take Shrimpo seriously, implying that Shrimpo doesn't actually bully other [[Toons]] out of malice, but likely just to annoy them, or intentionally start fights with them.
*Despite what he says, Shrimpo seldom physically harms [[Toons]] and only threatens to, like putting thumbtacks in {{CI|Looey|name=true}}'s room. However, he does do so out of spite like when he pushed [[Gourdy]].
**This is likely why no one seems to care much about him, and why Gardenview even keeps him, if because, and only because he does not physically hurt anyone except at last resort.
*{{CI|Bobette|name=true}} is the only [[Holiday Main Character]] to have an interaction with Shrimpo. 
**She and {{CI|Ginger|name=true}} are the only Toons who apologize to Shrimpo during their dialogue with him.
*{{CI|Brusha|name=true}}, {{CI|Gigi|name=true}}, {{CI|Eclipse|name=true}} and [[Finn]] are some of the only [[Toons]] to not mind Shrimpo's bullying and in fact respond positively, with Finn being glad Shrimpo remembers his facts, Gigi treating Shrimpo like a spunky friend, Eclipse gets excited by Shrimpo's yelling and starts to howl, and Brusha shrugs it off to further hide her insecurities.
**Some Toons like [[Blot]], {{CI|Yatta|name=true}}, [[Vee]], [[Flyte]], [[Poppy]] and [[Tisha]] could also count. Yatta compliments Shrimpo's strength (likely without the true intention of making him angry at all, with her tone of voice throwing it off), Vee simply just waits until Shrimpo says something before quickly shutting down the conversation, Poppy and Tisha try in vain to prove him wrong, Flyte continues being mellow even in his presence, and Blot claps back with an unintelligible insult.
*Shrimpo is the first [[Toon]] to be optimized in a patch and not a minor update, the second being [[Toodles]].
*Shrimpo is one of the [[Toons]] to have a [[Skin]] in the [[2025 Care Bears Collab]], the others being {{CI|Astro|name=true}} and {{CI|Shelly|name=true}}. 
**He is the only one out of the 3 to not be a [[Main Character]]. 
**His Skin, alongside Astro's {{Skin|Bedtime Bear}} and Shelly's {{Skin|Cheer Bear}} Skin, is also permanently unobtainable.
*Shrimpo shares equal mobility [[stats]] with {{CI|Soulvester|name=true}}.
*Shrimpo is the second [[Toon]] to appear in 2 different thumbnails, being the [[Changelog|v0.11]] and v0.12.7 thumbnails.
*Shrimpo is one of the 3 [[Toons]] to lack a 3 Star Stat, the others being [[Bassie]] and [[Gourdy]]. This is because of his status as a joke character and as well as only meant to be played as a challenge.
*Shrimpo's low [[Extraction Speed]] and [[Skill Check]] is most likely due to him banging his head against the [[Machine]] instead of extracting it normally, making it hard to focus on Skill Checks and turning the valve.
*Shrimpo is strong enough to tear holes through walls and knock punching bags off of their chains as seen in his room in [[Roleplay]].
**Interestingly, when asked about it, [[Qwelver]] would attempt to run away if Shrimpo challenged ''her'' to a fight,<ref>https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=D8WKOmi9OTI&pp=ygUZc2hyaW1wbyBjb3VsZCBiZWF0IHlvdSB1cA%3D%3D</ref> either implying he is far more capable of hurting people or that his role of antagonist in the [[Show]] makes fighting him a scary thought.
*Shrimpo is the first [[Toon]] to have 1{{Star}} in [[Skill Check]], with the second being {{CI|Cosmo|name=true}}, the third being {{CI|Bassie|name=true}}, and the fourth being [[Blot]].
*Shrimpo is the first [[Toon]] to have generally the same walk and run and animation with a slight difference after his optimization, the second being {{CI|Tisha|name=true}}.
*Shrimpo, alongside [[Brightney]], [[Brusha]], {{CI|Glisten|name=true}}, [[Teagan]], and all base game [[Main Characters]], are the only toons that have a gossip with all Shopkeepers.
*If you enter the [[Aquatic Floor]] as Shrimpo and go to his section, he will say "{{Text|I HATE THIS PLACE!! NOT ENOUGH PICTURES OF ME!!!}}" making him the fourth [[Toon]] (along with [[Brusha]], [[Finn]], {{CI|Goob|name=true}}, [[Scraps]], and [[Tisha]]) with dialogue outside of being in the [[Elevator]], using an [[Ability]], or finishing a [[Machine]].
*The Treasure Hunt poster in the [[Aquatic Floor]] depicts Shrimpo underwater without any equipment. Befitting how he is an aquatic creature, this makes him the first and currently only [[Toon]] we know is able to breathe underwater.
*Shrimpo, alongside [[Coal]], are the only Toons that have never been shown smiling at all, both in-game or in any official doodles.
**In fact, they are the only Toons that have never made any other face expressions at all, apart from scowling.
*Shrimpo is one of the few [[Toons]] to be required to be played as to get a medal, being {{TTI|Hissy Fit|name=true}}.
*Shrimpo is currently the only [[Toon]] to say his own name in the third-person.
*Shrimpo actually appears in the [[Swimmy Barnaby Machine]], with him matching the background.
*Shrimpo is the first [[Toon]] to be a confirmed antagonist of the [[Show]], the second being {{CI|Waxwell|name=true}}.
*Shrimpo is one of two [[Toons]] with a different render for their Character Card [[Profile]] "(image)", the other one being [[Waxwell]].
**With [[Gigi]]'s [[Toon of the Week]] teased to come shortly after the update, and her Profile render being her updated render, it is likely that Shrimpo will get his Toon of the Week after her or at least in the near future.

